# Financial correctness

- Store and compute money as `Decimal` / `DECIMAL(18,2)`. Never `float` for money.
- API money fields are string decimals plus ISO currency.
- Engines are pure services over typed inputs. They do not touch HTTP.
- Amounts on transactions are `>= 0`; direction comes from `type`.
- Protected funds and emergency balances are excluded from Current Safe to Spend.
- Capital contribution to a business is not household lifestyle spend.
- Every new engine formula needs a unit test before it is wired to an endpoint.
- AI (Phase 11+) may only narrate numbers already produced by an engine.
